<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN 292 ALL OUT V SRI LANKA (331) - TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN 292 ALL OUT V SRI LANKA (331) - TEA.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan, replying to Sri Lanka's first innings total of 331, were all out for 292 at tea on the third day of the second and final test on Monday.</p>
</text>
